            "description": {
              "value": "You can squeeze out of tight situations surprisingly quickly, gaining an advantage against foes that try to pin you down.\n\nYou gain the Quick Squeeze skill feat, and if you're a master in Acrobatics, you can Squeeze at full Speed. Whenever you successfully Escape using Acrobatics, the creature you Escaped from is flat-footed against the next attack you make against it before the end of your next turn."
